SPECIAL NOTE ABOUT FORWARD LOOKING STATEMENTS
This annual report includes “forward looking statements” within the meaning of the Private Securities Litigation Reform
Act of 1995, principally under the captions “Item 3. Key Information—Risk Factors,” “Item 4. Information on the Company”
and “Item 5. Operating and Financial Review and Prospects.” We have based these forward looking statements largely on our
current beliefs and projections about future events and financial trends affecting our business. Many important factors, in
